# Copy to .env and edit. The arena CLI loads .env from the repository root
# before it reads anything else; a variable already set in your shell wins.
# Every line below is optional, and `arena doctor` shows what will be used.

# --- Credentials ----------------------------------------------------------
# Without a key, runs use this machine's Claude Code login and bill that
# account. With one, they bill the key's account. `arena run` prints which
# credential it will use, masked, before it spends anything.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...

# --- Defaults for `arena run` ---------------------------------------------
# The flag always wins over the variable. The models under test, comma-
# separated, one more matrix dimension each. Sweep cheaply with sonnet or
# haiku; the headline comparison wants every tier.
# ARENA_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# ARENA_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001,claude-sonnet-5-5,claude-opus-5-5

# The model that grades research answers (3 samples per run by default).
# ARENA_JUDGE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5

# Cost ceiling in USD for ONE run. A run is stopped once it has spent this
# (checked between model turns).
# ARENA_MAX_COST_USD=1.00

# --- Where things live -----------------------------------------------------
# Results root for the CLI. Default: results/ in the repository. The site
# reads the same variable, but from its own environment, not from this file.
# ARENA_RESULTS_DIR=/absolute/path/to/results

# --- Terminal --------------------------------------------------------------
# NO_COLOR=1       no colour
# FORCE_COLOR=1    colour even when piped (CI logs, screenshots)
